        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOPRT, Portofino Lever with Georgetown Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditionally styled Portofino Lever With Georgetown Rose made by Grandeur features an elegant design. The slightly curved Portofino Lever grants this leverset an air of romance with subtle victorian detail. This door lever style is a classic for a reason. The simplistic appearance means that it is great for almost any style home from the most modern apartment to a century-old period home and every decor in between. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and the matching Georgetown Rose gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOPRT Portofino Lever With Georgetown Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Portofino Lever With Georgetown Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GEO-rose.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Georgetown Rosette Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Portofino Lever with Georgetown Rose, Grandeur GEOPRT",
                "description": "Grandeur GEOPRT, Portofino Lever With Georgetown Rosette - Traditionally styled, Portofino Lever With Georgetown Rose made by Grandeur features an elegant design. The slightly curved Portofino Lever grants this leverset an air of romance with subtle victorian detail. This door lever style is a classic for a reason. The simplistic appearance means that it is great for almost any style home from the most modern apartment to a century-old period home and every decor in between. The wave lever is forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware and the matching Georgetown Rose gives this entry set a clean design suitable for a wide array of decor applications from traditional to historic to contemporary. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Portofino Lever With Georgetown Roses, Portofino Lever With Georgetown Rosettes, GRA-GEOPRT, Grandeur GEOPRT, Grandeur Georgetown series, wave levers, Georgetown Rose With Portofino Levers, Georgetown Rosette with Portofino Levers,"
